# Viridian Forest (and the gate on Route 22, which FireRed gives the same MUS_VIRIDIAN_FOREST; Diglett's Cave and
# the Seafoam Islands share it later): a hushed walk under the trees in A minor, a flute's slow line over long
# chords and a soft tapping. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K2).
